{#- Seasonal corner decoration at the top right of every page (dates in src/_data/seasonal.js; the Home skyline
    has its own). One season at a time, in this order: halloween, poppies, christmas (plus santa on 24 Dec),
    easter, stgeorge, blossom, harvest. Each has three versions; a hash of the page's URL picks one (pickOf
    filter), so neighbouring pages usually differ. Not on Home, whose skyline has its own. Decorative only: hidden from screen readers, never takes clicks. -#}
{%- set sv = page.url | pickOf(3) -%}
{%- set sk = '' -%}
{%- if page.url != '/' -%}
{%- if not sk and seasonal.halloween %}{% set sk = 'halloween' %}{% endif -%}
{%- if not sk and seasonal.poppies %}{% set sk = 'poppies' %}{% endif -%}
{%- if not sk and seasonal.christmas %}{% set sk = 'christmas' %}{% endif -%}
